      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yankee_Lake%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "After the lake drained in 1979, Yankee Lake reinvented itself with motocross races, a seafood buffet, and rock concerts.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
